    <string name="motd">\u001b[1;33mNibras Terminal\u001b[0m · %1$s · %2$s\n\nPackages:  install &lt;pack&gt;  (video, download, pdf, apk, python…)  ·  pkg install &lt;name&gt;\nMenu:      nibras  ·  Store in the left drawer\nDo things: video merge a.mp4 b.mp4 · download &lt;url&gt; · pdf merge · image resize · ocr\nHelp:      ask \"how do I …\"  ·  explain &lt;command&gt;  ·  learn  ·  nibras-help\nPhone:     nibras-clipboard-get, nibras-battery-status, nibras-toast …  ·  storage: nibras-setup-storage\nLanguage:  lang\n</string>
    <string name="shell_help" formatted="false">Nibras Terminal commands\n\n  install [pack]                  packs: video audio image pdf download web git python node dev apk\n                                  backup net ocr share webterm desktop llm quran prayer games learn …\n  nibras                          menu of all tools (AZ/TR/EN/RU)\n  video · audio · image · pdf     merge, cut, convert, compress (ffmpeg, ImageMagick, qpdf)\n  download &lt;url&gt;                  videos/music (yt-dlp), files (aria2)\n  web · share · webterm · qr      web server, WebDAV/FTP/DLNA, terminal in PC browser, QR codes\n  ask · explain · fix · recipes   find the right command, explain one, fix typos\n  trash · snapshot · backup       safe delete, save/restore the whole environment, backups\n  notes · vault · clip · record   Markdown notes, encrypted vault, clipboard history, session recording\n  cron · plugin · hs · sysinfo    scheduled jobs, your own commands, history search, system info\n  llm · quran · prayer · games · learn\n  pkg install|remove|search|update|upgrade &lt;pkg&gt;\n  nibras-shell bash|zsh|fish      login shell  ·  nibras-sshd [port]  SSH server (8022)\n  nibras-desktop · nibras-adb · nibras-rish · nibras-apk\n  nibras-edit &lt;file&gt; · nibras-files · nibras-hosts · nibras-dialog · nibras-job-scheduler\n  nibras-* phone API: clipboard, toast, notification, battery, torch, camera-photo, location,\n                      sensor, volume, wallpaper, wifi-scaninfo, sms, speech-to-text …\n  ~/.shortcuts/ widget scripts · ~/.nibras/boot/ boot scripts · ~/.nibras/plugins/ your commands\n\nKeys: Volume-Down = Ctrl · Volume-Up + W/A/S/D = arrows, E = Esc, T = Tab, Q = extra keys\nKeyboard: Ctrl+Alt+C new session · Ctrl+Alt+N/P next/prev · Ctrl+Alt+V paste · Ctrl+Alt +/- font</string>
